cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Chromapi in your work, please cite as below."
title: "Chromapi: an open-source 12-DoF quadruped robot"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ousmane
    family-names: Thiongane
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-9812-5540"
    website: "https://mowibox.github.io"
version: 1.0.0
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mowibox/chromapi"
url: "https://mowibox.github.io/chroma/en/chromapi/"
abstract: >-
  Chromapi is an fully 3D-printable open-source 12-DoF quadruped robot built around a Raspberry Pi and a custom STM32 motherboard.
  This repository holds its Python SDK (real robot and MuJoCo simulation, locomotion, inverse kinematics), 
  the Raspberry Pi set-up and its URDF and MJCF models for reinforcement learning applications.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - quadruped robot
  - legged locomotion
  - Raspberry Pi
  - MuJoCo
